OL,3,GNEWSASeven people taken to hospital
OL,4,Aafter A96 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after a crash closed the A96
OL,8,Fin Aberdeenshire.
OL,10,FThe three-vehicle collision happened
OL,11,Fnear Huntly, by the Portsoy junction,
OL,12,Fshortly before 07:00.
OL,14,FFive ambulances, an air ambulance and
OL,15,Ftwo special operations response teams
OL,16,Fwere dispatched to the scene, along
OL,17,Fwith fire and police crews.
OL,19,FFive patients were taken to Aberdeen
OL,20,FRoyal Infirmary, including two by air
OL,21,Fambulance, and two were taken to Dr
OL,22,FGray's Hospital in Elgin.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
